{
  "_comment": "Schema configurations shared by e2e/scripts/gen-migration-fixtures.mjs (which turns them into BetterAuthOptions) and the Go tests (which turn them into db.Options). Field attributes use the upstream shape; a field without \"required\" is required, as upstream. {\"$fn\": \"date\"} is a function default returning new Date(), {\"$fn\": \"now\"} one returning Date.now(). \"base\" is migrated first (by the implementation under test), then \"setup\" SQL runs, then the plan for \"options\" is recorded. \"dialects\" restricts a config; \"skipApply\" lists dialects on which the target plan is not applied (e.g. SQLite cannot add a NOT NULL column without a default); \"reportUnsafe\" plans with throwOnUnsafe: false.",
  "configs": [
